{
  "date": "2025-11-26",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머해~",
      "en": "What are you doing~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 근데 갑자기",
      "en": "But all of a sudden..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 감동이다",
      "en": "I'm so touched."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 연락하면",
      "en": "When I reach out..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "달려와주는사람이 있다는게",
      "en": "Knowing there are people who come running for me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "몰라 감성적이여졌어",
      "en": "I don't know, I got emotional."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 좋네~",
      "en": "It feels so nice~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "Entp아닌거같아",
      "en": "I don't think I'm an ENTP."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자꾸 연지랑 수민이가",
      "en": "Yeonji and Soomin keep saying..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리 같은 엠비티아이자나~ ~",
      "en": "\"We have the same MBTI~~\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면",
      "en": "Whenever they say that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리가…?",
      "en": "\"Us...?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가..?",
      "en": "\"Me...?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이렇게 된다",
      "en": "That's how I end up reacting."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "엔팁이 아니고 싶은 건 아니지??????",
      "en": "It's not that you *don't* want to be an ENTP, right??????"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "동족혐오라구?",
      "en": "Are you saying it's self-hatred toward my own kind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엔팁이 원래 엔팁이기 싫어해? ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "Do ENTPs normally dislike being ENTPs? ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "추구엔비티아이 뭔데",
      "en": "Then what's your ideal MBTI?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나는",
      "en": "For me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음",
      "en": "Hmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "E는 좋아",
      "en": "I like E."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 맞는것같아",
      "en": "And I think it suits me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "Ending",
      "en": "\"Ending.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니",
      "en": "No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자동완성",
      "en": "Autocomplete."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐냐",
      "en": "What is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "끝내버리네",
      "en": "It completed the whole thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이엔티제이",
      "en": "ENTJ."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자세히는 모르는데",
      "en": "I don't really know the details."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 알파벳 특성만 봤을때",
      "en": "Just judging from what each letter represents."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 J 되는날 나 흰머리 가득할듯",
      "en": "By the day you become a J, I'll probably be full of gray hair."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 머리도 ㅎ",
      "en": "Mine too. ㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "**(8 minutes later)**"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 미안",
      "en": "I'm really sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "빠르게 얼굴 로션 챱챱",
      "en": "I quickly slapped some lotion on my face."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하고왔어",
      "en": "Then came back."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사막될것같아서",
      "en": "It felt like my face was turning into a desert."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 하고있는게 많은데",
      "en": "I'm working on a lot of things right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 당장말고",
      "en": "Not something immediate."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘",
      "en": "But these days..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기대해~",
      "en": "Please look forward to it~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "스포?",
      "en": "Spoiler?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "스포하면 재미없지~",
      "en": "It wouldn't be fun if I spoiled it~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음 조금만 하자면",
      "en": "If I were to give just a tiny hint..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와 트리플에스 멋있다",
      "en": "\"Wow, tripleS is so cool.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 스포임ㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "That's seriously a spoiler. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하석…?",
      "en": "Haseok...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요런 느낌~ ~",
      "en": "Something like that~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 내가 요즘",
      "en": "Also lately..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "꿈을 진짜 이상하게 꾸고",
      "en": "I've been having really weird dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "꿈에 지배당하는 기분이야",
      "en": "It feels like my dreams are controlling me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "피곤하면 그런가",
      "en": "Maybe it's because I'm tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어제꾼 꿈은",
      "en": "The dream I had yesterday..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "말해도 되려나",
      "en": "I wonder if I should tell it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥",
      "en": "Well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "갑자기 그",
      "en": "Suddenly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이세계아이돌 분들 알아?",
      "en": "Do you know Isegye Idol?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그중에 고세구님이 계신데",
      "en": "Gosegu was in the dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "고세구님이 나와서",
      "en": "She appeared..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "헐 진짜 팬이에요",
      "en": "\"Wow, I'm really a fan!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "제가 전에 영상도 자주보고~ 멤버 뽑는 오디션같은 컨텐츠도 보고~",
      "en": "\"I used to watch your videos all the time, and even the member audition content!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면서 했더니",
      "en": "I was saying that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사진 찍자고 하셔서",
      "en": "Then she asked to take a picture together."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떻게 찍지 했는데",
      "en": "I wondered how we'd take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "티비같은 모니터에 세구님이 있으시고",
      "en": "She was on a TV-like monitor."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "세구님 대역해주시는 여자분이랑",
      "en": "There was also a woman acting as her body double."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안고 찍고 업혀서 찍고",
      "en": "We took hugging photos and piggyback photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러다 무슨 대기실 갔는데",
      "en": "Then we went into some waiting room."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엄지윤님께서",
      "en": "Eom Ji-yoon was there."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엄지훈남 분장하시고",
      "en": "She was dressed as her 'handsome guy' character."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "메이크업을 지우고 계셨는데",
      "en": "She was removing her makeup."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "딱 정 중앙만 지우시고 계셔서",
      "en": "But she'd only removed the middle part."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어엇",
      "en": "\"Huh...?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하다가",
      "en": "I was like that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가",
      "en": "Then I said..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "옛날에 샵 겹쳤었잖아요!!",
      "en": "\"We used to go to the same salon before!!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면서 오오 안녕하세요",
      "en": "We greeted each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러다 내 매니저님이 가야한다고 데려가서 차에 탔는데",
      "en": "Then my manager said we had to leave, so I got into the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "막 계속 똑같은자리를 뺑뺑 돌다가",
      "en": "We just kept driving around the exact same place."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다왔어요",
      "en": "\"We've arrived.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하는데",
      "en": "Then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아까 있었던곳에 내리라는겨",
      "en": "They told me to get out at the exact same place."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 왜 차에 탄거죠??? 뮝?",
      "en": "\"Then why did we get in the car???\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자꾸 다른곳이라고 하시고",
      "en": "They kept insisting it was a different place."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 들어갔는데 갑자기",
      "en": "Then I went inside..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무슨 서커스같은 공연하는데",
      "en": "And suddenly there was some circus performance."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 배우라는거야",
      "en": "They told me I was one of the performers."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "불 피워놓고 안으로 들어가래",
      "en": "There was fire and they told me to go inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사람들 몰래",
      "en": "Without anyone noticing."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안타는 기름? 같은거에 들어갔다 나오고",
      "en": "Going into some kind of non-burning oil and coming back out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 이걸 꾸면서 든 생각이",
      "en": "While dreaming it I kept thinking..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이거 현실인데 왜자꾸 꿈같지",
      "en": "\"This is reality, so why does it feel like a dream?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이생각을 계속 했어",
      "en": "I kept thinking that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자꾸 정신차리자",
      "en": "\"Wake up.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러고",
      "en": "I kept telling myself that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "일어나자마자 시온언니한테",
      "en": "As soon as I woke up, I told Shion-unnie."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "썰풀어줌",
      "en": "I told her the whole story."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "시온이가 뭐래?",
      "en": "What did Shion say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하도 많이 말해서",
      "en": "I've told her so many dreams..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이제는 그냥",
      "en": "Now she just says..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음~ 피곤했나보네~",
      "en": "\"Hmm~ You must've been tired~\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이럼",
      "en": "That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "전에는",
      "en": "Before..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엥? 진짜? 오잉",
      "en": "\"Huh? Really?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이렇게 해줬었는뎈ㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "She used to react like that. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "근데 꿈을 어떻게 이렇게 자세히 다 기억해? 난 일어나면 금방 다 까먹던데",
      "en": "How do you remember your dreams so clearly? I forget mine almost immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 임팩트있는 꿈이면 다기억나",
      "en": "If it's an impactful dream, I remember everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "몇년전 꿈도 기억나",
      "en": "I even remember dreams from years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 진짜 신기한게",
      "en": "And what's really amazing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "꿈 초반에 의미없이 나왔던 장면이",
      "en": "A scene that seemed meaningless at the beginning..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나중에 일어날일에 떡밥이였고",
      "en": "Ends up being foreshadowing for something later."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "막 이래서",
      "en": "Things like that happen."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 신기해",
      "en": "It's really fascinating."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다 짜여진 각본같고",
      "en": "It's like a perfectly written script."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "꿈이 되게 드라마처럼 전개될 때 신기함",
      "en": "It's amazing when dreams unfold like a drama."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞아 진짜",
      "en": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 요즘 현실이 꿈같아",
      "en": "But these days reality itself feels like a dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "**Y/n**랑 있으니까…",
      "en": "Because I'm with **Y/n**..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사실 진짜 꿈같음",
      "en": "Honestly, it really does."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "막 이것저것하고 막 대기도 하고 샵도 갔다오고 했는데",
      "en": "Doing all sorts of things, waiting around, going to the salon..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아무것도 안한것같고",
      "en": "Yet it feels like I did nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "막 실감이 안나게 막 지나가",
      "en": "Everything passes by without feeling real."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "촬영을 하는중인건가..? 벌써 다 한건가 지금 뭐하는거지",
      "en": "\"Are we filming? Are we already done? What am I doing now?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아무것도 안했는데 뭔가 되어있으니 럭키비키잖아?",
      "en": "Nothing happened but everything worked out, so that's Lucky Vicky."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "완전 긍정적이다..",
      "en": "That's incredibly positive..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "image": "image-01.webp"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엥 진짜였네?",
      "en": "Huh? It was real?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎ",
      "en": "ㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너만의 루돌프가 되",
      "en": "I'll become your very own Rudolph."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그럼 하연이 코는 빨개?",
      "en": "Then is your nose red?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "반짝여",
      "en": "It sparkles."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "눈 내리면 밟지마",
      "en": "Don't step on the snow when it falls."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뽀득소리는 눈의요정 뼈가 부러지는 소리라던데",
      "en": "They say that crunching sound is the snow fairies' bones breaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 눈의 요정이거든 사실",
      "en": "Because I'm actually a snow fairy."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "정하연 뼈뿌러졋나",
      "en": "Did Jeong Hayeon's bones break?"
    },
